# Netlify Drop reads this file directly (no netlify.toml build step needed).
# Proxies /api/* through Netlify's own edge to the Flask API on Render, so the
# browser only ever talks to your Netlify domain and anime.js's existing
# fetch('/api/...') calls work unchanged — no CORS setup needed.
#
# Edit the URL below to your deployed Render API, then re-drop this folder
# (or drag just this edited file onto the same site in the Netlify dashboard).
/api/*  https://REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-API.onrender.com/api/:splat  200!
